H3XD live medium, built on Arch Linux.

The graphical session runs the H3XD installer. When it is closed, the
screen offers to start it again, open the network settings, restart or
power off. Text consoles on Ctrl+Alt+F2 to F6 accept root without a password.

Wired networks with DHCP connect on their own. For Wi-Fi use nmtui
(or iwctl), for mobile broadband (WWAN) modems use mmcli.

The console keyboard is US. For Czech run: loadkeys cz-us-qwertz
Pause then locks US on or off, AltGr switches for a single key.

